&nbsp;

Members of the Connections Planning team understand consumer trends and are able to translate insights and strategic direction into actionable media solutions. They interact with a wide range of other teams including Intelligence and Strategic Planning, the specialist channel teams that execute the media, and the Live Planning team that optimises across all media channels.

Working closely with and supporting&nbsp;Connections Planners&nbsp;along with Strategic planning and Client Leadership&nbsp;makes up a large proportion of an Associate’s time and means you will have the opportunity to learn how Mindshare&nbsp;approaches&nbsp;the definition and design of the audiences, connections, content, and measurement that comprise our media solutions. The bulk of your time will be spent supporting the team in planning exciting, award-winning campaigns as well as working with channel specialists to make those plans a reality.

